<text x="2" y="88" size="1.8" layer="21" ratio="12">POTS Audio Bridge rev A - 120 x 90 mm, 2 layers. LEFT of the slot is LINE-REFERENCED.</text>
<text x="2" y="76" size="1.4" layer="21" ratio="12">The 600:600 transformer T1 is the only isolation barrier. Keep the slot clear of copper.</text>
<text x="44" y="88" size="1.4" layer="21" ratio="12">SELV side: hybrid, 40 dB receive pad, 15 dB transmit pad, headset, hook driver.</text>
<text x="2" y="6" size="1.4" layer="21" ratio="12">Not a certified DAA. See the design doc before connecting to a public network.</text>
